","metatag_title":"Valley of Genius","metatag_description":"Ripped from the pages of Adam Fisher's uncensored history of Silicon Valley, Valley of Genius features the hackers, founders, and freaks who made Silicon Valley boom, in their","metatag_image":"https://elroy.twit.tv/sites/default/files/styles/twit_album_art_1400x1400/public/images/shows/valley_of_genius/hero/voghero11-18.jpg","weight":"0","_links":{"self":{"title":"Self","href":"https://twit.tv/api/v1.0/shows/667491"}},"_embedded":{"credits":[{"id":"187","label":"Leo Laporte : Host","self":"https://twit.tv/api/v1.0/credits/187","cleanPath":"/credits/leo-laporte-host","ttl":600,"roles":{"id":"76","label":"Host","self":"https://twit.tv/api/v1.0/roles/76","ttl":600,"weight":"0","vid":11,"type":"roles","vocabularyName":"Roles","termPath":"host","_links":{"self":{"title":"Self","href":"https://twit.tv/api/v1.0/roles/76"}}},"people":{"id":"21","label":"Leo Laporte","self":"https://twit.tv/api/v1.0/people/21","cleanPath":"/people/leo-laporte","ttl":600,"positionTitle":"Chief TWiT","bio":"<h2>Founder and owner of the TWiT Podcast Network</h2><p>He launched the network in 2005 with its first show, <a href=\"https://twit.tv/shows/this-week-in-tech\"><em>This Week in Tech</em></a>, and continues to host that show and others on the network, including <a href=\"https://twit.tv/shows/macbreak-weekly\"><em>MacBreak Weekly</em></a>, <a href=\"https://twit.tv/shows/security-now\"><em>Security Now</em></a>, <a href=\"https://twit.tv/shows/intelligent-machines\"><em>Intelligent Machines</em></a>, and <a href=\"https://twit.tv/shows/windows-weekly\"><em>Windows Weekly</em></a>. He directs the network as a whole, hiring staff, originating new shows, and approving all advertising.</p><p>Leo posts occasionally on his blog <a href=\"https://leo.fm/\">leo.fm</a>. He posts photos at <a href=\"http://www.leo.camera/\">leo.camera</a>. He can also be found on <a href=\"https://twit.social/@leo\" rel=\"me\">TWiT's official Mastodon instance, TWiT.social</a> and the TWiT Forums at <a href=\"https://twit.community\">TWiT.community</a>.</p><p>He signs all email with <a href=\"https://www.openpgp.org/\">OpenPGP</a> and you can send him encrypted messages using his <a href=\"https://keyoxide.org/hkp/92C6B23216618FD65D354C3FB3000DC64567B47C\">public key</a>.</p><p>His full bio is at <a href=\"https://leo.fm/about/\">leo.fm/about</a>.</p>","bioSummary":"","picture":{"fid":"152069","url":"https://elroy.twit.tv/sites/default/files/people/21/pictures/Leo_v1.jpg","fileName":"Leo_v1.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","derivatives":{"thumbnail":"https://elroy.twit.tv/sites/default/files/styles/thumbnail/public/people/21/pictures/Leo_v1.jpg","twit_album_art_70x70":"https://elroy.twit.tv/sites/default/files/styles/twit_album_art_70x70/public/people/21/pictures/Leo_v1.jpg","twit_album_art_144x144":"https://elroy.twit.tv/sites/default/files/styles/twit_album_art_144x144/public/people/21/pictures/Leo_v1.jpg","twit_album_art_240x240":"https://elroy.twit.tv/sites/default/files/styles/twit_album_art_240x240/public/people/21/pictures/Leo_v1.jpg","twit_album_art_300x300":"https://elroy.twit.tv/sites/default/files/styles/twit_album_art_300x300/public/people/21/pictures/Leo_v1.jpg","twit_album_art_600x600":"https://elroy.twit.tv/sites/default/files/styles/twit_album_art_600x600/public/people/21/pictures/Leo_v1.jpg","twit_album_art_1400x1400":"https://elroy.twit.tv/sites/default/files/styles/twit_album_art_1400x1400/public/people/21/pictures/Leo_v1.jpg","twit_album_art_2048x2048":"https://elroy.twit.tv/sites/default/files/styles/twit_album_art_2048x2048/public/people/21/pictures/Leo_v1.jpg"},"fileSize":"338042","width":1600,"height":1600,"alt":"Leo Laporte","title":"Leo Laporte","status":"1","changed":"2026-01-07T23:45:34Z","created":"2026-01-07T23:45:34Z"},"relatedLinks":[{"url":"https://leo.fm/","title":"Blog","attributes":[],"original_title":"Blog","original_url":"https://leo.fm/"},{"url":"https://www.leo.camera/","title":"Ph